<script setup lang="ts">
import DismissibleNotice from './DismissibleNotice.vue';
import DeveloperPanel from './DeveloperPanel.vue';
import {ref,watch} from 'vue';import type {ViewModel} from '../app/useWorkspace';
const props=defineProps<{w:ViewModel}>();const chosen=ref('');watch(()=>props.w.formatErrors.entries[0]?.id,id=>{chosen.value=id||'';});
</script>
<template><section class="surface format-error-page"><header class="panel-heading"><div><p class="eyebrow">LOGS / 运行记录</p><h1>运行日志</h1></div><button :disabled="!w.formatErrors.entries.length" @click="w.formatErrors.clear();chosen=''">清空记录</button></header><DeveloperPanel :w="w" /><p class="muted">仅保存在当前浏览器，最多保留最近 100 条。记录连接失败、超时、接口报错和格式错误；格式错误保留对应返回文本。</p><DismissibleNotice :message="w.formatErrors.problem" error /><p v-if="!w.formatErrors.entries.length">暂无运行日志。</p><details v-for="(entry,i) in w.formatErrors.entries" :key="entry.id" :open="chosen?chosen===entry.id:i===0" @toggle="event=>{if((event.target as HTMLDetailsElement).open)chosen=entry.id}"><summary>{{new Date(entry.at).toLocaleString()}} · {{entry.code==='STATE_COMPAT_RECOVERED'?'格式兼容记录':entry.kind==='runtime'?'运行错误':'格式错误'}} · {{entry.code}}</summary><p v-if="entry.code==='STATE_COMPAT_RECOVERED'" class="muted">本轮已兼容处理，有效内容已保存；无效或缺失的状态字段沿用旧值。下方保留模型原始返回供核查。</p><p v-if="entry.sessionId" class="muted">会话 {{entry.sessionId}}<span v-if="entry.turnId"> · 楼层 {{entry.turnId}}</span></p><pre v-if="chosen?chosen===entry.id:i===0">{{entry.raw}}</pre></details></section></template>
<style scoped>.format-error-page details{border-bottom:1px solid var(--color-border);padding:14px 0}.format-error-page summary{cursor:pointer;color:var(--color-accent)}pre{white-space:pre-wrap;overflow-wrap:anywhere;max-height:60dvh;overflow:auto;font:13px/1.8 monospace}</style>
